1
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,200
SYMBOL is the name of the instrument.

2
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:14,500
BID is the price you sell at.

3
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:18,800
ASK is the price you buy at.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,500
SPRD is the gap between buying and selling.

5
00:00:23,600 --> 00:00:28,800
These tabs sort everything into groups.

6
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:35,400
Forex shows currency pairs.

7
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:41,700
Crypto shows coins like Bitcoin.

8
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:47,900
Indices shows market indexes.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,100
Commodities shows gold, silver and oil.

10
00:00:54,200 --> 00:01:00,300
Stocks shows company shares.

11
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:05,200
All puts everything back in one list.

12
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:10,300
Use search to find anything fast.

13
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:18,000
Type a few letters and the list narrows down.

14
00:01:18,100 --> 00:01:25,900
Right click a row to buy, sell, or set an alert.

15
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:30,800
Majors is your own saved list of favourites.

16
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:36,800
Click any row to load that instrument on the chart.

